## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology | Version |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| Framework | React | 19 |
| Bundler | Vite | 8 |
| Language | TypeScript | 5.9 |
| Graph editor | @xyflow/react (React Flow) | 12 |
| GPU rendering | PixiJS (WebGL2 preference) | 8 |
| UI components | MUI + Emotion | 9 |
| Fonts | JetBrains Mono Variable (primary), Inter Variable | @fontsource |
| Persistence | Dexie (IndexedDB wrapper) | 4 |
| Geometry | polygon-clipping | 0.15 |
| Routing | react-router-dom | 7 |
| ML | SAM (Segment Anything) via web worker, Marigold depth/normals via backend API |

No Tailwind, no shadcn. Styling is MUI `sx` prop + plain CSS files in `flow-nodes/styles/`. The MUI theme (`src/theme.ts`) is a custom dark theme with Geist/Vercel-inspired tokens, monospace typography (JetBrains Mono 700), 6px spacing unit, and dense control sizing.

