## Processor System (`node-engine/processors/`)

### BaseProcessor (abstract)

- `def: ProcessorDef` — type, title, category, input/output handles, defaultParams.
- `execute(inputs, params, engine) → Record<string, any>` — pure computation per frame.
- `alwaysDirty: boolean` — if `true`, the engine marks this node dirty every frame.
- RT management: `ensureRT(w, h)`, `ensurePing(w, h)`, `ensurePong(w, h)` — reuses `RenderTexture` when dimensions match, destroys on resize.
- `val(inputs, params, key, fallback)` — priority: connected input > widget param > fallback.
- `resolveRes(inputs, params, engine)` — resolution priority: explicit width/height > `source` texture > `sdf`/`coords_tex` > any texture > engine defaults (900x1200).

### Slot Types

`TEXTURE`, `POLYGON`, `NUMBER`, `VEC`, `DEPTH_RAW`, `CONFIG`, `CONTOUR`, `PULSE`, `SIGNAL`, `ANIMATION`, `METRICS`, `ANY` (wildcard). Connection validation uses `SLOT_COMPAT` table.

### Signal Types

- `PulseSignal` — discrete tap event: `{ count, lastTimestampMs, lastX?, lastY? }`.
- `Signal` — continuous 0..1 driver: `{ value, time, age, state, lastTimestampMs }`.
- `ChannelSignal` — per-channel in animation: `{ time, raw, value, state }`.
- `AnimationSignal` — `{ channels: Record<string, ChannelSignal> }`.
- `EffectMetrics` — per-frame profiler payload from EffectProcessor: `{ effectName, totalMs, cpuMs, gpuDispatchMs, passes: PassMetric[], timestampMs }`. `PassMetric` carries `{ id, kind, cpuMs, skipped }`.

### Processor Categories & Catalog (28 types)

**Input** (6): `number`, `image`, `polygon`, `segmentation`, `sdfTextAtlas`, `textStrip`
**Image ops** (5): `blur`, `remap`, `blend`, `denoise`, `sdfFromContour`
**Contour** (1): `contourResample` (Chaikin/Laplacian smoothing, arc-length resampling)
**Depth** (2): `depthEstimate` (web worker), `depthBlit` (raw → texture)
**AI/ML** (3, hidden): `materialEstimate`, `marigoldDepth`, `marigoldNormals` (backend API)
**Animation triggers** (2): `tap` (pointer → PulseSignal), `autoTimer` (time-based waveforms)
**Animation modulators** (2): `envelope` (pulse → shaped signal), `combineSignals` (add/max/min/mul/mix)
**Animation controller** (1): `animationController` — universal 8-slot mapper. Inputs `signal_0..signal_7` (raw 0..1) plus optional `config` (CONFIG, supplies per-effect slot labels and default min/max). Output `signal: AnimationSignal` keyed by index strings `'0'..'7'`. Per-slot params `min_i`/`max_i`.
**Output** (3): `effect` (multi-pass shader compositor; emits `texture` + `metrics`), `preview` (pass-through + canvas extract), `contourPreview`
**Utility** (3): `config` (effect selection + params passthrough), `noiseVisualizer` (pattern-warp preview of canonical fbm), `log` (effect timing inspector)

**`alwaysDirty` processors**: `effect`, `tap`, `autoTimer`, `envelope`, `combineSignals`, `animationController`. The `log` processor relies on dirty-propagation from upstream Effect — it's not alwaysDirty itself, so an unwired Log node sits idle and adds zero per-frame cost.

